OL,3,GNEWSACompulsory purchase considered for
OL,4,Aroundabout plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors will be urged to approve
OL,7,Fthe use of compulsory purchase powers
OL,8,Fto obtain land for a road improvement
OL,9,Fscheme in Barnsley.
OL,11,FThe A635/A633 Stairfoot Improvement
OL,12,Fscheme would see the roundabout
OL,13,Fenlarged to provide three continuous
OL,14,Ftraffic lanes and increase capacity on
OL,15,Fseveral of its approaches.
OL,17,FIf approved on 9 September, it would
OL,18,Fenable Barnsley Council to acquire the
OL,19,Fland necessary to deliver the project,
OL,20,Fthough details of the affected plots
OL,21,Fhave not been published.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
